cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these notebooks or data, please cite this repository and the
  accompanying Physical Review X article.
type: software
title: "resource_theory_mpemba: reproducible notebooks and data"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python notebooks and raw data accompanying
  "Resource-Theoretical Unification of Mpemba Effects: Classical and
  Quantum." The repository covers classical and quantum thermal relaxation,
  symmetry restoration, modes of asymmetry, and U(1)- and SU(2)-symmetric
  random circuits.
